Call recording runs the unmodified scrcpy-server v5.0.1 binary, which is verified
by SHA-256 before use:
  764eb6f79811d5211fe9df341120882ba9994c7a61b897d7bf3fb662e53bc536
  - "core" build (F-Droid): scrcpy-server is NOT included. The user downloads it
    from the official scrcpy release and imports it in the app.
  - "foss" build (GitHub "-bundled" APK) and "gplay" build: scrcpy-server is
    included as the asset "scrcpy-server", downloaded from
    https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/releases/tag/v5.0.1 at build time.

